msgid ""
"Which parameters will be displayed can easily be changed in the script and "
"parameter screens can be applied globally, by vehicle types, and/or by "
"individual model."
msgstr "要显示哪些参数可以在脚本里轻松修改，参数页面可以全局应用、按载具类型应用，和/或按单个机型应用。"

